🛠 Installation & Setup
1️⃣ Clone Repository
git clone https://github.com/Nirmaljyts/erp_project.git
cd UI

2️⃣ Install dependencies
npm install

3️⃣ Create .env file
VITE_API_URL="http://localhost:5000/api"

4️⃣ Run development server
npm run dev

Local URL: http://localhost:5173

5️⃣ Build for production
npm run build
npm run preview

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔐 Authentication Flow (JWT)

User logs in using /auth/login

Access + Refresh tokens stored in httpOnly cookies

Axios interceptor refreshes token automatically

Redux Toolkit stores user info

Protected routes check user role

👮 Role-Based UI Logic
Role	Permissions
ADMIN	Full access, create/edit/delete holidays
HR	Same as ADMIN
MANAGER	View only
EMPLOYEE	View only

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

📅 Holiday Calendar Module (FullCalendar)

Features:

Click a date → Create holiday modal

Click an event → Edit/Delete modal

Tooltip includes:

Name

Country

Holiday type (optional / public)

Color coding:

Green → Public Holiday

Purple → Optional Holiday

Bulk holiday upload (.csv)

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🎨 Theme System

Uses CSS variables defined for both themes:

--background
--text
--card
--border

Automatically applied to:

Modals | Calendar | Forms | Layout

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔔 Notifications (react-hot-toast)

Used for:

Login success / failure

Holiday created / updated / deleted

CSV upload results

Validation errors


API CORS blocked

Backend must allow:

origin: "http://localhost:5173"
credentials: true

